{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"The simulation completed all three worlds and rescued all 18 creatures. Browser testing caught a pause-menu focus bug and a phone briefing that could push Launch offscreen. It also exposed a missed short key tap and a flaw in the test helper’s event handling. I’m fixing those before the next full run."}}
