{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_39","type":"agent_message","text":"The art review found two readability problems: the title caption crossed a bright planet, and the HUD lost contrast over terrain. I’ve added darker backing and adjusted the lighting. I also corrected beam and projectile orientation, added a harmless sentinel charge, and made touch controls show Leave only when the shuttle can depart."}}
